**Document type:** Game Concept & Preliminary Game Design Document (GDD)  
**Project name:** MAZERUSH  
**Genre:** 3D Multiplayer Combat Shooter  
**Perspective:** Third-person  
**Primary platform:** Mobile  
**Development status:** Concept and pre-production  
**Working tagline:** *Enter the Maze. Survive the Rush.*

