# 13. Monetisation Strategy

The proposed business model is free-to-play with optional purchases.

The core objective is to generate revenue without making the competitive experience unfair.

## 13.1 Free Content

The free experience should provide meaningful access to the game.

Potential free features:

- Core combat.
- Competitive gameplay.
- Standard characters.
- Standard weapons.
- Core maps.
- Public matchmaking.
- Basic progression.

Competitive maps should not be divided between paying and non-paying players in a way that fragments matchmaking.

## 13.2 Optional Purchases

Potential revenue sources:

- Character skins.
- Weapon skins.
- Cosmetic bundles.
- Emotes.
- Seasonal passes.
- Cosmetic effects.
- Optional themed expansions.

## 13.3 Competitive Fairness

The game should avoid pay-to-win mechanics.

Purchases should primarily provide cosmetic value rather than superior damage, health or weapon performance.

